<title>USA: Evergreen adopts calendar fiscal year.</title>
<headline>Evergreen adopts calendar fiscal year.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen Resources Inc said Tuesday it has changed the company's fiscal year-end to December 31 from March 31.</p>
<p>Evergreen said it will provide audited financial statements for a &quot;short&quot; nine-month period ended December 31, 1996, and for 12-month periods thereafter.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
